> h_bad' " vs " %4.2f `acq_sh_other' ") - re-check acq_bad"

. else display "   10%+ foreign share: `acq_bad' " %4.2f `acq_sh_bad' " vs middle of other years " %4.2f `acq_sh_other' 
> " (`acq_bad' answers treated as unknown)"
